{
    "title": "Demosphere",
    "description": "The new Demosphere mobile app is a one-stop communication tool for sports enthusiasts to stay on track during the season. Members can access teams, rosters, calendar events, game assignments, messaging tools and more!\r\n\r\nIt is important to note the Demosphere app is permission-based. For members to access the app, administrators first need to set permissions. Only teams with permissions turned on can be accessed from the app.\r\n\r\nBenefits of the app include:\r\n - Full integration with Demosphere\u2019s sports management system, including teams, rosters, and schedules (practices, games, assignments and other events)\r\n - Members will be able to use one app across all teams, sports and organizations that are partnered with Demosphere\r\n - Access to households, profiles, registration orders and payments\r\n - Branded look with team logo and colors\r\n - Administrative control over which teams are visible on the app\r\n - Messaging capabilities between admins, team staff, parents, players, and officials\r\n - Referee/Game Official assignments and schedules",
    "descriptionHTML": "The new Demosphere mobile app is a one-stop communication tool for sports enthusiasts to stay on track during the season. Members can access teams, rosters, calendar events, game assignments, messaging tools and more!<br><br>It is important to note the Demosphere app is permission-based. For members to access the app, administrators first need to set permissions. Only teams with permissions turned on can be accessed from the app.<br><br>Benefits of the app include:<br> - Full integration with Demosphere\u2019s sports management system, including teams, rosters, and schedules (practices, games, assignments and other events)<br> - Members will be able to use one app across all teams, sports and organizations that are partnered with Demosphere<br> - Access to households, profiles, registration orders and payments<br> - Branded look with team logo and colors<br> - Administrative control over which teams are visible on the app<br> - Messaging capabilities between admins, team staff, parents, players, and officials<br> - Referee/Game Official assignments and schedules",
